  "prefLabel": "Rev 302.04 Use of Separate Accounting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 302.04 Use of Separate Accounting. Business organizations shall not determine their New Hampshire business activity for tax purposes by separately computing the net income or loss for business locations within New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #4192, eff 12-23-86; amd by #4438, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5490, eff 10-19-92; amd by #5910, eff 10-14-94; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
